1
00:00:03,197 --> 00:00:07,249
To run a recipe you have, open Tools, Deployments, JSON Import.

2
00:00:07,249 --> 00:00:11,242
The editor suggests the names of the steps as you type, so you

3
00:00:11,242 --> 00:00:13,297
do not have to remember them.

4
00:00:14,505 --> 00:00:19,729
It also describes each setting, and underlines a mistake before anything runs.

5
00:00:19,729 --> 00:00:22,715
When the recipe looks right, click Import.

